orge World Editor</h3><p>A working world-authoring surface in SliceForge Studio, still in development. Paint cells, generate the scene, and playtest the same map.</p><a class="text-link" href="/world-editor/">Explore World Editor <span>↗</span></a></div></article><article class="product-card"><div class="product-image lilac"><img src="/studio-images/sloth-crystal-guide-landscape-v3.png" alt="Strategic Sloth mascot as a crystal guide in a lavender low-poly landscape" loading="lazy"></div><div class="product-info"><span class="status neutral">Concepts in development</span><h3>World of Warcraft addons</h3><p>Interface and quality-of-life experiments for players, with class-inspired sloth character concepts.</p><a class="text-link" href="/wow/">See the concepts <span>↗</span></a></div></article></div><div class="note"><h3>More to share as the work takes shape.</h3><p>Game and tool projects will appear here as they become ready to show.</p></div></section><section class="contact-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD SOMETHING GOOD</p><h2>Your next idea.<br>Our kind of challenge.</h2></div><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Work with the studio <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
